{
  "scene_id": "scene.book002.008_queens_assessment.scene001",
  "description": "@scene_id: scene.book002.008_queens_assessment.scene001",
  "entities": [
    {
      "id": "torhh",
      "name": "Torhh",
      "health": 100.0,
      "max_health": 100.0,
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 0.0,
        "z": 0.0
      },
      "type": "character",
      "layout_source": "fallback_linear"
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 37,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Status report,\"",
        "line": 45
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 38,
      "actor": "Marduk",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Construction timeline extended by estimated thirty-seven solar cycles across all seven sites,\"",
        "line": 47
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Show me.\"",
        "line": 49
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 50,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Bring me one,\"",
        "line": 65
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 54,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I did not ask for containment. I asked for proximity. Arrange diplomatic contact.\"",
        "line": 71
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 55,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"My Queen, the indigenous biologicals have demonstrated no capacity for abstract communication. Their consciousness-patterns suggest\u2014\"",
        "line": 73
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 82,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You are Eduhauana,\"",
        "line": 110
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 84,
      "actor": "Eduhauana",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I am the Sovereign of this system,\"",
        "line": 113
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 85,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This world is ours by five hundred years of building together. By Garden grown from survivors' trauma. By cooperation chosen freely between different kinds.\"",
        "line": 115
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 91,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Your construction damages our sacred sites,\"",
        "line": 124
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 99,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mathematics of power,\"",
        "line": 134
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 101,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yet here you are, facing them again.\"",
        "line": 137
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 102,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yes.\"",
        "line": 139
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 107,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we will learn from their lesson. We will resist better. Longer. We will make your conquest cost more than this world is worth to you.\"",
        "line": 146
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 115,
      "actor": "Eduhauana",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I appreciate your honesty,\"",
        "line": 158
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"My Queen?\"",
        "line": 165
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 120,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"These indigenous biologicals are more sophisticated than our initial assessments suggested,\"",
        "line": 167
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 121,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Recommend delayed occupation? Return during Second Coming with purpose-built suppression forces?\"",
        "line": 169
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 122,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No. Recommend psychological warfare.\"",
        "line": 171
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 124,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"United, they present significant resistance capability. But what if they were... divided?\"",
        "line": 174
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 128,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Precisely. Observe: the ocean-colored ones require moisture, cool temperatures, access to deep water. The desert-adapted ones thrive in heat and aridity. The forest-dwellers need vegetation and rainfall. These environmental requirements create natural tensions that cooperation currently suppresses.\"",
        "line": 180
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 136,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Each lie contains just enough truth to take root. We plant them through the Igigi\u2014they interface with Giants during construction, they can deliver misinformation without Giants recognizing the source. Over time, cooperation becomes suspicion. Unity fragments. And when we return for the Second Coming...\"",
        "line": 190
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 137,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Giants will have suppressed themselves,\"",
        "line": 192
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 139,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exactly. And the most beautiful aspect: they won't remember we caused it. After three thousand years, the lies we plant will have become genuine cultural divergence. They'll believe their mistrust is organic, that their factions were always meant to be separate.\"",
        "line": 195
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 145,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And when we return?\"",
        "line": 203
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 146,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"When we return, we'll find a world pre-suppressed, its indigenous resistance capabilities degraded by millennia of self-inflicted division. Then we deploy the Nephilim-class forces, complete the network properly, and move this world from contested to controlled status.\"",
        "line": 205
      }
    }
  ],
